{"key":"apphy2-mcq-005","kind":"mcq","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"increase","working":"Electric potential energy is U = qV. In a uniform electric field, electric potential increases when moving opposite the field direction: ΔV = -E Δx, and moving opposite E gives ΔV > 0. For a positive charge q > 0, ΔU = qΔV > 0, so the electric potential energy increases. Equivalently, the electric force on a positive charge is along E, so moving it opposite E requires external work against the electric force, increasing its potential energy.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":402,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":146,"cacheReadTokens":256},"outputTokens":648,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":138,"reasoningTokens":510},"totalTokens":1050,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":402,"completion_tokens":648,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":146,"total_tokens":1050,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":510}},"reasoningTokens":510,"cachedInputTokens":256},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":6967,"keyed_label":"B"}
{"key":"apphy2-mcq-006","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"A","final_answer":"zero","working":"Let the two identical positive charges +q be located at positions -d and +d along the horizontal x-axis. By Coulomb's law, the electric field created by each positive charge points radially away from it. At the midpoint (x = 0), the left charge produces an electric field directed to the right of magnitude E = kq/d^2, while the right charge produces an electric field directed to the left of the same magnitude E = kq/d^2. By the principle of superposition, the two vectors are equal in magnitude and opposite in direction, so they cancel out completely, yielding a net electric field of zero.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":360,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":360,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":441,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":165,"reasoningTokens":276},"totalTokens":801,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":276,"promptTokenCount":360,"candidatesTokenCount":165,"totalTokenCount":801,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":360}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":165}]},"reasoningTokens":276,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":4320,"keyed_label":"A"}
